WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.565
It was late at night in Metro City Park.

2
00:00:06.566 --> 00:00:10.716
In the lake the frogs croaked softly.

3
00:00:10.717 --> 00:00:15.282
Suddenly a bright object fell from the sky.

4
00:00:15.283 --> 00:00:17.745
It splashed into the lake.

5
00:00:17.746 --> 00:00:21.240
The water bubbled up and turned purple.

6
00:00:21.241 --> 00:00:25.566
Ribbit! Ribbit!

7
00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:30.441
The next day Roxy and her friends were in the woods in Metro City Park.

8
00:00:30.442 --> 00:00:34.822
"Look at me!" called Terrell from the top of a giant boulder.

9
00:00:34.823 --> 00:00:37.796
"I'm taller than everyone!"

10
00:00:37.797 --> 00:00:41.257
"I'm coming up there!" said Mara.

11
00:00:41.258 --> 00:00:44.955
"Me too!" said Roxy.

12
00:00:44.956 --> 00:00:48.167
The two girls started climbing up.

13
00:00:48.168 --> 00:00:50.593
"Not me," said Jack.

14
00:00:50.594 --> 00:00:53.377
"I don't like high places."

15
00:00:53.378 --> 00:00:57.009
"You're scared of high places?" asked Mara.

16
00:00:57.010 --> 00:00:59.716
"I'm not scared," said Jack.

17
00:00:59.717 --> 00:01:02.961
"I just don't like being high up."

18
00:01:02.962 --> 00:01:06.993
Terrell shrugged. "That's okay," he said.

19
00:01:06.994 --> 00:01:09.342
"I don't like the dark."

20
00:01:09.343 --> 00:01:12.286
"I'm scared of monsters," said Mara.

21
00:01:12.287 --> 00:01:16.162
"Especially ones with fangs!"

22
00:01:16.163 --> 00:01:19.245
"That's not a problem," said Terrell.

23
00:01:19.246 --> 00:01:22.846
"Rocket Girl can protect us from monsters."

24
00:01:22.847 --> 00:01:24.564
He looked at Roxy.

25
00:01:24.565 --> 00:01:27.198
"What are you afraid of, Roxy?"

26
00:01:27.199 --> 00:01:29.449
Just then Mara called out.

27
00:01:29.450 --> 00:01:33.466
"Oh look! I see a frog under those leaves!"

28
00:01:33.467 --> 00:01:38.612
Mara jumped down and picked up the small frog.

29
00:01:38.613 --> 00:01:41.819
Terrell and Jack walked over.

30
00:01:41.820 --> 00:01:45.676
"Eww! Eww!" said Roxy.

31
00:01:45.677 --> 00:01:48.406
"What's wrong?" asked Mara. "Keep

32
00:01:48.407 --> 00:01:53.810
that frog away from me," said Roxy. "Gross!" "So

33
00:01:53.811 --> 00:01:57.607
you're scared of frogs?" said Jack. "I'm

34
00:01:57.608 --> 00:02:01.564
not scared ," said Roxy uneasily.

35
00:02:01.565 --> 00:02:04.980
"I just think they're . . . gross."

36
00:02:04.981 --> 00:02:08.697
"Maybe Rocket Girl can help you," said Terrell.

37
00:02:08.698 --> 00:02:11.329
"Help me?" asked Roxy.

38
00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:13.913
"Yeah," said Terrell.

39
00:02:13.914 --> 00:02:17.094
"Help you not to be scared of frogs."

40
00:02:17.095 --> 00:02:20.826
Roxy frowned. "I just said I'm not—"

41
00:02:20.827 --> 00:02:23.667
Ribbit! Ribbit!

42
00:02:23.668 --> 00:02:27.654
"What was that?" asked Jack, looking around.

43
00:02:27.655 --> 00:02:31.130
"It sounded like a frog," said Terrell.

44
00:02:31.131 --> 00:02:33.672
"But it was really loud."

45
00:02:33.673 --> 00:02:37.158
Nearby a tree fell over.

46
00:02:37.159 --> 00:02:41.218
Crack! Another tree crashed down.

47
00:02:41.219 --> 00:02:49.425
Smash! The friends held their breath as a huge creature moved closer.

48
00:02:49.426 --> 00:02:53.829
"It . . . It's a frog!" cried Terrell.

49
00:02:53.830 --> 00:02:57.474
"It's a huge frog!" said Mara.

50
00:02:57.475 --> 00:03:01.293
"It's bigger than a car!" said Jack.

51
00:03:01.294 --> 00:03:07.277
Croak! The giant frog hopped into the air and was gone.

52
00:03:07.278 --> 00:03:09.366
Roxy's face turned pale.

53
00:03:09.367 --> 00:03:13.875
A moment later her watch beeped.

54
00:03:13.876 --> 00:03:16.881
Roxy moved away from her friends.

55
00:03:16.882 --> 00:03:20.890
She pressed a button and Mayor Bloom's face appeared.

56
00:03:20.891 --> 00:03:24.220
"Let me guess, Mayor," whispered Roxy.

57
00:03:24.221 --> 00:03:27.744
"You're calling about the giant frog."

58
00:03:27.745 --> 00:03:31.452
"It's not just one, Rocket Girl!" cried the mayor.

59
00:03:31.453 --> 00:03:33.653
"Giant frogs are everywhere!

60
00:03:33.654 --> 00:03:36.148
They're invading Metro City!

61
00:03:36.149 --> 00:03:42.775
Please do something!"

